# Trainee footage is NOT committed.
#
# This repository is public. The source clips show an identifiable person, and
# the brief this template is built to is explicit about protecting them, so the
# footage stays out of git history — which is the one place you cannot take it
# back from.
#
# Drop before.mp4 / after.mp4 into public/ locally and the template runs.
public/*.mp4
public/*.mov
public/*.m4v

# Rendered reels — deliver these to the client, don't version them.
public/music/
